    ROLLOUTS -. drives canary/primary split .-> SERVER
    ROLLOUTS -. drives canary/primary split .-> WEB
    CONFIG -. mounted by .-> MOCK
    CONFIG -. mounted by .-> ACCT
    CONFIG -. mounted by .-> SERVER
    CONFIG -. mounted by .-> WEB
